{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新想\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他亲身试过，真去做能让自己从无力里动起来，可那股力气没能让他放下对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"从无力里动起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可争取和那种生活带来的安慰，他都舍不得，光怀念又护不住眼下珍惜的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"都舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到争取可能耗掉温柔，心里还是疼，也盼着少伤一点的办法，可眼前该争取的事不能一直搁着。\",\n      \"key\": \"少伤一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里还没安稳，就先接下眼前该担的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下眼前该担的事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后重新考虑能做什么，仍没底，不把重新考虑写成已经有答案。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"压缩重复的行动赋能经验，同时明说行动能让他从无力里动起来，却没法消掉对那种生活的牵挂。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把旧愿带来的安慰、光怀念护不住珍惜之物的限度、争取可能磨掉温柔的代价和他对自己的自责放回具体取舍里，明说两边都舍不得，不由作者替他宣布领悟。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把不行动的代价并入光怀念护不住珍惜之物，把心疼、盼着少伤一点和不能搁置眼前的事合在一起，删去等待无用的格言式重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重复的行动原则，保留他心里还没安稳却先接下眼前责任的实际变化，让害怕未消而前进已经发生。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ad88d4a-1496-4857-b8d0-465581e027da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190945110225Z", "elapsed_seconds": 329.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:15:14.532701+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e96e450848401dd9561861db53c7cedd0e33dbcf086c548dad3c04483978a6ed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "8